{
  "name": "SEC Form 4 Insider Buying Alerts to Telegram (Apify)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SEC Form 4 Insider Buying Alerts -> Telegram\nPowered by **Mehdad DataLabs** on Apify:\nhttps://apify.com/mehdad-datalabs/sec-form-4-insider-trading-scraper-xml-parser-api\n\n**What this does:**\n1. Runs daily (or manually)\n2. Scrapes live SEC Form 4 XML filings\n3. Filters & ranks insider purchases\n4. Routes Mega-Buys ($500K+) vs Standard Buys ($50K+) to Telegram",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1773e71e-8e43-4233-afc1-10dd07953151",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 1: Configure Workflow\nOpen **Set Workflow Config** and replace:\n- `apifyToken`: `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`\n- `telegramChatId`: `YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID`\n- `tickers`: comma-separated tickers (e.g. `NVDA,AAPL,MSFT`)\n- `minTradeValue`: minimum USD value (default `50000`)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "c2a4bf57-96a9-4306-bcd3-dcccb1c9c6e7",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 2: Filter & Rank Trades\n- Drops non-qualifying or empty filings\n- Sorts purchases largest-first and formats clean Markdown alerts",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "571c1fd7-87bb-4492-92a5-cc9a5d9d484f",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 3: Tiered Telegram Alerts\n- **Mega-Buy (>= $500,000):** High-priority alert\n- **Standard Buy (>= $50,000):** Daily watch alert",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "92d8c325-17ad-47ff-98f3-e993604e6a6f",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9d0520a0-b72c-4e68-9800-e41d21971583",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "5d619db5-44fa-467a-b23b-cc29e132aa58",
      "name": "Manual Test Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "620da4b5-4e49-4d4e-9c4c-bb29b7eaf559",
              "name": "apifyToken",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9cc0fb3a-c5f0-4ff2-b552-766a03617ddb",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ad4c3725-82eb-4acd-bf84-db5d737e43f8",
              "name": "tickers",
              "value": "NVDA,AAPL,MSFT,AMZN,META",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "7f314ce2-32d4-41e4-ae43-08b5835147f8",
              "name": "minTradeValue",
              "value": 50000,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "ff1d0825-d6bb-4e95-afa5-ab47996f0e27",
              "name": "megaBuyThreshold",
              "value": 500000,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3dd5c2c-6fed-4db2-9983-1faf62d03a68",
      "name": "Set Workflow Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/mehdad-datalabs~sec-form-4-insider-trading-scraper-xml-parser-api/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $json.apifyToken }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ tickers: $json.tickers.split(\",\").map(t => t.trim()), transactionCodes: [\"P\"], maxFilingsPerTicker: 10 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "71f2ad1f-390e-4511-8a51-a14a5335091d",
      "name": "Run Apify SEC Form 4 Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6a7865f3-7f98-4569-9345-f8a11f961f13",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.totalValue || $json.transactionValue || 0) }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Set Workflow Config').item.json.minTradeValue }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "db5bfe92-b8d1-49d6-b36b-388f2d2c4540",
      "name": "Filter Qualifying Buys",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst cfg = $('Set Workflow Config').first().json;\nconst sorted = items\n  .map(i => {\n    const d = i.json;\n    const val = Number(d.totalValue || d.transactionValue || 0);\n    return {\n      ...d,\n      numericValue: val,\n      tier: val >= Number(cfg.megaBuyThreshold) ? 'mega' : 'standard',\n      formattedValue: '$' + val.toLocaleString('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 }),\n      telegramChatId: cfg.telegramChatId,\n      markdownMessage: [\n        val >= Number(cfg.megaBuyThreshold) ? '🚨 *MEGA INSIDER BUY*' : '📈 *SEC Form 4 Insider Buy*',\n        `*Ticker:* ${d.ticker || 'N/A'} (${d.companyName || 'Company'})`,\n        `*Insider:* ${d.insiderName || 'N/A'} — ${d.insiderTitle || 'Officer/Director'}`,\n        `*Value:* $${val.toLocaleString('en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })} (${d.shares || '?'} shares @ $${d.pricePerShare || '?'})`,\n        `*Filing Date:* ${d.filingDate || d.transactionDate || 'Recent'}`,\n        d.filingUrl ? `[View SEC Filing](${d.filingUrl})` : ''\n      ].filter(Boolean).join('\\n')\n    };\n  })\n  .sort((a, b) => b.numericValue - a.numericValue);\n\nreturn sorted.map(row => ({ json: row }));"
      },
      "id": "5549651f-e123-43f9-89da-093620621901",
      "name": "Rank & Format Alerts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2fea9d7d-87f4-4003-98ba-3dcf3cc8bae9",
      "name": "No Qualifying Trades",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1280,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tier }}",
                    "rightValue": "mega",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Mega-Buy ($500K+)"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tier }}",
                    "rightValue": "standard",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Standard Buy"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a17107ae-af24-4b9e-acc1-e849b60e5668",
      "name": "Route by Trade Size",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.markdownMessage }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "disable_web_page_preview": true
        }
      },
      "id": "037d45f3-3582-49de-ace0-72605f99519a",
      "name": "Send Mega-Buy Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1820,
        180
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.markdownMessage }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "disable_web_page_preview": true
        }
      },
      "id": "8ae2053c-0e34-4acb-8342-90c8e935cf19",
      "name": "Send Standard Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1820,
        360
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
